<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten pellet, meal prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten pellet, meal prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten meal and pellet prices stayed flat Thursday, cash sources said. The Christmas and New Years holiday has slowed buying interest, dealers said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  102.00    102.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   90.00     90.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
